<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1818539839"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:18.320"><div begin="0.679" end="25.996" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="0.679" end="6.845" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.679" end="1.288">阳</span><span begin="1.288" end="2.429">光下的</span><span begin="2.429" end="2.990">泡</span><span begin="2.990" end="3.797">沫</span> <span begin="4.201" end="4.768">是</span><span begin="4.768" end="5.060">彩</span><span begin="5.060" end="6.094">色</span><span begin="6.094" end="6.845">的</span></p><p begin="7.766" end="13.986" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.766" end="9.982">就像被骗的</span><span begin="9.982" end="10.990">我</span> <span begin="11.289" end="12.089">是幸</span><span begin="12.089" end="13.144">福</span><span begin="13.144" end="13.986">的</span></p><p begin="14.819" end="21.141" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.819" end="15.621">追究</span><span begin="15.621" end="16.584">什么</span><span begin="16.584" end="17.045">对</span><span begin="17.045" end="17.856">错</span> <span begin="18.470" end="18.887">你</span><span begin="18.887" end="19.224">的</span><span begin="19.224" end="20.240">谎</span><span begin="20.240" end="21.141">言</span></p><p begin="21.924" end="25.996" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.924" end="22.500">基</span><span begin="22.500" end="23.677">于你还</span><span begin="23.677" end="24.243">爱</span><span begin="24.243" end="25.996">我</span></p></div><div begin="28.107" end="53.246" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="28.107" end="34.921" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.107" end="29.040">美丽</span><span begin="29.040" end="29.390">的</span><span begin="29.390" end="29.889">泡</span><span begin="29.889" end="31.406">沫</span> <span begin="31.544" end="32.527">虽然</span><span begin="32.527" end="32.893">一</span><span begin="32.893" end="33.472">刹</span><span begin="33.472" end="34.302">花</span><span begin="34.302" end="34.921">火</span></p><p begin="35.148" end="41.964" itunes: